@PastaList.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7208

### Health probe
GET {{PastaList.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Request a development login code
# The code is written to the API log in Development.
POST {{PastaList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/request-code
Origin: https://localhost:7208
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com"
}

### Verify the login code
POST {{PastaList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/verify
Origin: https://localhost:7208
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "code": "000000"
}

### Current session
GET {{PastaList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Logout
POST {{PastaList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: https://localhost:7208

### Get all lists
GET {{PastaList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists
Accept: application/json

### Create a list
# @name createList
POST {{PastaList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekly groceries",
  "description": "Everything for the week"
}

### Get a single list
@listId = {{createList.response.body.id}}
GET {{PastaList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists/{{listId}}
Accept: application/json

### Add an item
# @name createItem
POST {{PastaList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists/{{listId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Penne rigate",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unit": "pack",
  "category": "Pasta",
  "note": null
}

### Toggle an item
PATCH {{PastaList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists/{{listId}}/items/{{createItem.response.body.id}}/toggle

### Delete the list
DELETE {{PastaList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/lists/{{listId}}
